msgstr "Entri bukti individual yang menyusun observasi ini: masing-masing adalah satu perilaku yang diamati beserta jenis sumber, kualitas bukti, dan level skala yang cocok."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation_evidence__source_type
msgid ""
"The kind of legitimate source this evidence was drawn from. A student's own "
"reflection is recorded as 'Reflection'. Only these sources are admissible as "
"character evidence (ICLAD Bab 17)."
msgstr "Jenis sumber sah tempat bukti ini diambil. Refleksi siswa sendiri dicatat sebagai 'Refleksi'. Hanya sumber-sumber ini yang dapat diterima sebagai bukti karakter (ICLAD Bab 17)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__agreement_result
msgid ""
"The overall agreement result of this session, e.g. the percentage of ratings "
"within one level of each other (inter-rater reliability)."
msgstr "Hasil kesepakatan keseluruhan sesi ini, mis. persentase penilaian yang selisihnya dalam satu level (reliabilitas antarpenilai)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__provisional_level_id
msgid ""
"The provisional scale level assigned to the student for this construct on "
"the basis of the evidence gathered. Taken from the configured character "
"scale; never hardcoded."
msgstr "Level skala sementara yang ditetapkan untuk siswa pada konstruk ini berdasarkan bukti yang terkumpul. Diambil dari skala karakter yang dikonfigurasi; tidak ditulis permanen di kode."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation_evidence__evidence_quality
msgid ""
"The quality tier of this evidence. The 'Invalid (Not Admissible)' tier "
"documents that the material -- e.g. rumor, impression, counseling notes, "
"psychological test results, or punishment data -- must NOT be used as "
"character evidence (ICLAD Bab 17); it may be recorded only to make that "
"exclusion explicit."
msgstr "Tingkat kualitas bukti ini. Tingkat 'Tidak Valid (Tidak Dapat Diterima)' menandakan bahwa materi tersebut -- mis. rumor, kesan, catatan konseling, hasil tes psikologis, atau data hukuman -- TIDAK boleh digunakan sebagai bukti karakter (ICLAD Bab 17); materi itu hanya boleh dicatat untuk menegaskan pengecualian tersebut."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__rating_ids
msgid ""
"The rating lines of this session: the level each participant assigned to "
"each anchor example."
msgstr "Baris penilaian sesi ini: level yang ditetapkan setiap peserta untuk setiap contoh jangkar."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration_rating__assigned_level_id
msgid ""
"The scale level this participant assigned to the anchor example, from the "
"configured character scale."
msgstr "Level skala yang ditetapkan peserta ini untuk contoh jangkar, dari skala karakter yang dikonfigurasi."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation_evidence__matched_level_id
msgid ""
"The scale level this piece of evidence is matched to, from the configured "
"character scale. Never hardcoded."
msgstr "Level skala yang dicocokkan dengan bukti ini, dari skala karakter yang dikonfigurasi. Tidak ditulis permanen di kode."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__subconstruct_id
msgid ""
"The specific sub-construct being observed, when the observation targets a "
"facet more granular than the construct itself."
msgstr "Subkonstruk spesifik yang diobservasi, bila observasi menargetkan aspek yang lebih rinci daripada konstruknya."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__student_id
msgid "The student whose character this observation is about."
msgstr "Siswa yang karakternya menjadi pokok observasi ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration_rating__participant_id
msgid "The teacher who gave this rating."
msgstr "Guru yang memberikan penilaian ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation_evidence__observer_id
msgid "The teacher who observed and recorded this behaviour."
msgstr "Guru yang mengobservasi dan mencatat perilaku ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__participant_ids
msgid "The teachers who took part in this calibration session."
msgstr "Guru yang mengikuti sesi kalibrasi ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__name
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign "
"number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' agar nomor dibuat otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan pada status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__activity_exception_decoration
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Jenis aktivitas pengecualian pada rekaman."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__message_unread
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__message_unread
msgid "Unread Messages"
msgstr "Pesan yang Belum Dibaca"

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__message_unread_counter
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__message_unread_counter
msgid "Unread Messages Counter"
msgstr "Penghitung Pesan yang Belum Dibaca"

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_school_character_evidence.school_character_calibration_user_group
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_school_character_evidence.school_character_observation_user_group
msgid "User"
msgstr "Pengguna"

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__user_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__user_id
msgid ""
"User that responsible for document\n"
"\n"
"* Create user can be different with responsible user\n"
"* Automatically filled with user that initiate document creation.\n"
"  Default responsible can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna yang bertanggung jawab atas dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pembuat dapat berbeda dengan penanggung jawab\n"
"* Otomatis diisi dengan pengguna yang memulai pembuatan dokumen.\n"
"  Penanggung jawab default dapat diubah."

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__reviewer_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__reviewer_id
msgid ""
"User that responsible to review document\n"
"\n"
"* Unless it configured to approve reviewer does not equal to approver"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna yang bertanggung jawab memeriksa dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Kecuali dikonfigurasi, pemeriksa tidak sama dengan penyetuju"

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_calibration__active_approver_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_evidence.field_school_character_observation__active_approver_user_ids
msgid "Users that can approve/reject document"
msgstr "Pengguna yang dapat menyetujui/menolak dokumen"

#. module: ssi_school_character_evidence
